## Workflow Structure

- Three-tier workflow strategy implemented
- Push workflow @.github/workflows/push.yml triggers
- PR workflow @.github/workflows/PR.yml gates
- Release workflow @.github/workflows/release.yml deploys
- Workflow dispatch for manual triggers
- Comprehensive timeout management (15-30 minutes)

## Caching Strategy

- Multi-layer caching for performance optimization
- Flutter SDK cache with version keys
- Pub dependencies with lockfile hashing
- Dart analysis cache for faster linting
- Test results cache for efficiency
- AVD cache for integration testing

```yaml
# Cache Flutter SDK
- name: Cache Flutter SDK
  uses: actions/cache@v4
  with:
    path: |
      /opt/hostedtoolcache/flutter
      ~/.flutter
    key: flutter-${{ env.FLUTTER_VERSION }}-${{ runner.os }}
```

## Prepare Job Pattern

- Centralized cache warming strategy
- Generate dynamic cache keys
- Pre-warm analyzer and formatter
- Output cache keys for jobs
- Minimize redundant dependency resolution
- 15-minute timeout for preparation

## Quality Gates Implementation

- Dart formatting with `dart format --set-exit-if-changed`
- Fatal analysis with `flutter analyze --fatal-infos --fatal-warnings`
- Security scanning for hardcoded secrets
- Dependency audit with `dart pub audit`
- Documentation completeness validation
- File structure verification

```yaml
# Security scan example
- name: Security scan
  run: |
    if grep -r "api_key\s*=\s*['\"][^'\"]\+['\"]" lib/; then
      echo "Hardcoded API key found"
      exit 1
    fi
```

## Testing Pipeline

- Unit tests with coverage generation
- Coverage threshold validation (60% minimum)
- Test randomization for reliability
- Integration tests on Android emulator
- AVD caching for faster execution
- Parallel test execution strategy

## Android Integration Testing

- KVM group permissions setup
- Android SDK automated configuration
- API level 30 emulator caching
- Snapshot generation for speed
- Hardware acceleration with swiftshader
- Headless emulator execution

```yaml
# AVD cache pattern
- name: AVD cache
  uses: actions/cache@v3
  with:
    path: |
      ~/.android/avd/*
      ~/.android/adb*
    key: avd-api-level-30
```

